WEBVTT

00:11:56.996 --> 00:12:03.329
I'm going to be the person to, like, jump
in and make this change where others,

00:12:03.329 --> 00:12:07.246
you know, may be hesitant or whatever
it is like I'm going to be the one.

00:12:07.787 --> 00:12:10.704
And so I was going to take
it in and try to help.

00:12:10.954 --> 00:12:15.246
And how did it feel putting so
much energy into a job and

00:12:15.246 --> 00:12:17.996
a culture that you knew deep
down was not right?

00:12:18.287 --> 00:12:23.371
It's almost like you're gaslighting
yourself, like you're telling yourself.

00:12:23.371 --> 00:12:27.454
No, no. Like all of the evidence
around you is not correct.

00:12:27.537 --> 00:12:32.037
There's just you just have to do this
one one little thing or do more.